Load the CPAL palette correctly so COLRv0 emoji render in color.

- source/text/font_hb.cpp: load the CPAL palette: hb_ot_color_palette_get_colors returns the palette size, the in/out count only says how many colors to copy, so COLRv0 emoji (Twemoji, Segoe UI Emoji) drew every layer black

diff --git a/source/text/font_hb.cpp b/source/text/font_hb.cpp
